---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions — jev.info" description="Terms and conditions for using jev.info.">
  <main class="shell policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Last updated · September 19, 2026</p>
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="lede">These interim terms describe the basic conditions for using jev.info while the project is under development.</p>
    <section>
      <h2>Community project</h2>
      <p>jev.info is a community index and is not an official Jev website. Information is provided for reference and may change as the underlying projects evolve.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Content and attribution</h2>
      <p>Posts, media, names, trademarks, and other third-party material remain the property of their respective owners. jev.info links to original sources whenever available.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>The site links to third-party services, including GitHub and X. We do not control their availability, content, or privacy practices.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>The site is provided as-is without warranties of accuracy, completeness, availability, or fitness for a particular purpose.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Changes and questions</h2>
      <p>These terms may be updated as the project develops. Questions can be submitted through the project’s GitHub issue tracker.</p>
      <a class="action" href="https://github.com/wizicer/jev_info_site/issues/new?title=%5BContact%5D%20Terms%20question&body=Please%20describe%20your%20question%20about%20the%20jev.info%20terms." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ask a question ↗</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-page { min-height: 66vh; padding-block: 76px 110px; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 720; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 32px); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .lede { max-width: 720px; margin: 20px 0 52px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
  section { max-width: 720px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; }
  section p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .action { display: inline-block; margin-top: 22px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
</style>
